Stage 2a -- wondertap plumbing that is safe with the feature switched OFF.

Adds only: the 3 QDF wondertap headers (new files, see the 3 untracked paths in
the tree), QDF_PASSTHRU_MODE, wlan_op_mode_passthru, WMI_VDEV_TYPE_WIFI_PASSTHRU,
the PM_PASSTHRU_* enum values, and the Kconfig/Kbuild/config_to_feature switch.

The policy table rows (1081 lines across 6 files) are NOT in this patch -- they
are produced by opairshare/insert_passthru_tables.py, which is validated against
the reference tree and refuses to run twice.

Apply from the tree root (/mnt/opairshare-build/opairshare) with:
    git apply opairshare/patches/0003-stage2a-qdf-enums-policy-buildchain.patch

Verified: with the feature OFF, the rebuilt qca_cld3_peach_v2.ko has an identical
ABI (587 imports / 588 versions / 0 exports, all CRCs equal) to the pre-change build.

